    "source": "# TSSOP-20: dimensions entered by their JEDEC MO-153 letters, plus a hand-solder variant.\n\ne  = 0.65            # pitch\nD  = 6.5             # body length\nE1 = 4.4             # body width\nE  = 6.4             # lead span, tip to tip\nb  = 0.25            # lead width\nL  = 0.6             # foot length\n\nfootprint \"TSSOP-20\"\n  refdes: \"U\"\n\n  body E1 x D x 1.2\n  pins 20 dual pitch: e\n  lead gullwing b x L span: E\n  pin1: dot\nend\n\nfootprint \"TSSOP-20-HS\" extends \"TSSOP-20\"\n  description: \"hand-solder variant: longer pads, roomier courtyard\"\n  default pad rect 0.4 x 1.8\n  courtyard: auto 0.5\nend\n"
