    "source": "# Chip resistor, 0402 (1005 metric): the same part described two ways.\n\nunits: mm\n\n# Land mode: enter the recommended land pattern.\nfootprint \"R0402\"\n  description: \"RES 0402, land pattern entered directly\"\n  refdes: \"R\"\n\n  pins 2 horizontal            # pin 1 left\n  default pad rect 0.5 x 0.6\n  gap: 0.5                     # inner edge to inner edge, as drawn\n  body 1.0 x 0.5 x 0.35        # optional; adds silk, courtyard and a 3D box\nend\n\n# Part mode: describe the part and let the pads be derived (IPC-7351 style).\nfootprint \"R0402-IPC\"\n  description: \"RES 0402, pads derived from part dimensions\"\n  refdes: \"R\"\n\n  body 1.0 x 0.5 x 0.35\n  pins 2 horizontal\n  lead endcap 0.25             # end cap length; the width defaults to the body width\n  density: nominal\nend\n"
