    "source": "# Radial aluminum electrolytic: cylindrical can, polarized, through-hole.\n\nfootprint \"CP-RADIAL-8x11.5-P3.5\"\n  description: \"Radial electrolytic, 8 mm can, 3.5 mm lead spacing\"\n  refdes: \"C\"\n\n  body cylinder d: 8 h: 11.5\n  pins 2 horizontal pitch: 3.5\n  lead wire d: 0.6\n  default pad tht circle 1.6 drill: 0.9\n  pad 2 tht rect 1.6 x 1.6 drill: 0.9  # square pad for the negative lead\n  polarized                            # pin 1 is positive; the stripe goes on pin 2's side\n  pin1: none                           # the stripe is the polarity mark\n\n  model\n    body color: \"#26476f\"              # dark blue sleeve\n    leads color: tin\n  end\nend\n"
